{title: 340 - Jesus Saves}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Gospel}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[F]We have heard a joyful sound, Jesus saves, Jesus [C]saves;
[C7]Spread the [F]gladness all around, Jesus [C]saves, [C7]Jesus [F]saves;
[Bb]Bear the news to every land, [F]Climb the steeps and cross the [C]waves,
[C]Onward, [F]'tis our [C]Lord's [Bb]command, [F]Jesus [C]saves, [C7]Jesus [F]saves.

Verse 2:
[F]ft it on [C]the rolling tide,
[C7][F]Jesus [C]saves, [C7]Jesus [F]saves;
[Bb]Tell to [F]sinners, far [C]and wide,
[C][F]Jesus [C][Bb]saves, [F][C]Jesus [C7][F]saves;
[F]Sing, ye islands [C]of the sea.
[C7]Echo [F]back, [C]ye [C7]ocean [F]caves,
[Bb]Earth [F]shall keep [C]her jubilee,
[C][F]Jesus [C][Bb]saves, [F][C]Jesus [C7][F]saves.

Verse 3:
[F]ng above [C]the battle's strife,
[C7][F]Jesus [C]saves, [C7]Jesus [F]saves;
[Bb]By His [F]death and [C]endless life,
[C][F]Jesus [C][Bb]saves, [F][C]Jesus [C7][F]saves;
[F]Sing it softly [C]through the gloom,
[C7]When [F]the [C]heart [C7]for [F]mercy craves,
[Bb]Sing in [F]triumph o'er [C]the tomb,
[C][F]Jesus [C][Bb]saves, [F][C]Jesus [C7][F]saves.

Verse 4:
[F]ve the winds [C]a mighty voice,
[C7][F]Jesus [C]saves, [C7]Jesus [F]saves;
[Bb]Let [F]the nations [C]now rejoice,
[C][F]Jesus [C][Bb]saves, [F][C]Jesus [C7][F]saves;
[F]Shout salvation [C]full and free,
[C7]Highest [F]hills [C]and [C7]deepest [F]caves,
[Bb]This [F]our song [C]of victory,
[C][F]Jesus [C][Bb]saves, [F][C]Jesus [C7][F]saves.
